   "title": "Remove the minus signs",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\sin(-100^\\circ)\\sin(-20^\\circ)=(-\\sin100^\\circ)(-\\sin20^\\circ)=\\sin100^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ\\\\[5pt]&-2\\sin(-100^\\circ)\\sin(-20^\\circ)=-2\\sin100^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ\\end{aligned}\\]",
